vLLM general plugin k31xlora for the ROCm Kimi-K3.1 model, batch-variant arm only: expert LoRA on the W4A16 path
(aiter Triton moe_gemm_a16w4 with punica expert LoRA, XLORA_FAST=1). Not batch invariant; the consistent arm must not
load it. Creates kimi-k31/k31xlora/ under /opt/k31-plugins. Upstream status: not yet proposed.

